{"id":"2804e12c027228d4","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-ipc-language.md","title":"Intuitionistic Propositional Syntax","display":"df-ipc-language — Intuitionistic Propositional Syntax","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-ipc-language","aliases":["89-df-ipc-language"],"display":"df-ipc-language — Intuitionistic Propositional Syntax","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-ipc-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-ipc-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ipc-language — Intuitionistic Propositional Syntax"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropVar}=\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropVar}=\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> 为本书模态语言的字母集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to\">\\(\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to\\)</span> 是 IPC 中自由生成的互异构造子，特别是 IPC 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor,\\to\">\\(\\lor,\\to\\)</span> 不按经典等价式展开。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ipc\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nI_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PropVar}\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\nI_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq I_n\\cup\\{A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\mid A,B\\in I_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}I_n,\\quad\n\\neg A\\coloneqq A\\to\\bot,\\quad\\top\\coloneqq\\bot\\to\\bot.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ipc\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nI_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PropVar}\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\nI_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq I_n\\cup\\{A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\mid A,B\\in I_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}I_n,\\quad\n\\neg A\\coloneqq A\\to\\bot,\\quad\\top\\coloneqq\\bot\\to\\bot.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条补齐本书实际使用但原压缩包未提供的基础接口；不恢复或冒充其他书籍的原文件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PropVar}=\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\land,\\lor,\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\lor,\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ipc\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nI_0&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PropVar}\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\nI_{n+1}&\\coloneqq I_n\\cup\\{A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\mid A,B\\in I_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}I_n,\\quad\n\\neg A\\coloneqq A\\to\\bot,\\quad\\top\\coloneqq\\bot\\to\\bot.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1000,"backlinks":[{"id":"f12af111ab11110d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}$ is the intuitionistic propositional\nformula set from [[89-df-ipc-language]]."},{"id":"b1c35d55817857e5","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"e